    "cookCount": 0,
    "nutrition": null,
    "directions": [
      "Wash 1lb Chicken with lemon and water",
      "Add 1tsp salt, 1tsp black pepper, 3 cloves garlic, 1 chopped onion, , 1 cup spring onions (Leave some over)",
      "1tsp pimento seeds.",
      "1 cup mixed peppers.",
      "3-4 branches of fresh thyme.",
      "1 tsp Chicken seasoning.",
      "Mix together and marinate for up to 8hrs or overnight.",
      "Pour 1tbsp vegetable oil into a pot on high heat.",
      "Then add left over garlic, onions, spring onions and cook for 3 mins.",
      "Then add 4 Tbsp. of Curry powder and 1tsp of cumin and cook well for 5 mins.",
      "Add ¼ cup water and mix together.",
      "Add the meat to the pot and mix well so that all the curry covers the meat.",
      "Cook meat for 15 mins – this will release the natural juices of the meet.",
      "Then add 1 cup of water.",
      "1 scotch bonnet pepper and mix well.",
      "Cook for further 35 mins.",
      "Then add 1 cup of chopped white potatoes and 1 cup chopped carrots.",
      "Mix well and cook for further 15 mins on medium high heat."
    ],
